      "items": [
        {
          "itemCode": "ERQ10_01",
          "content": "想让自己体验更多积极情绪（例如喜悦或觉得有趣）时，我会调整当下正在想的事情。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 0,
          "responseSetKey": "erq_agreement_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ERQ10_02",
          "content": "我习惯把自己的情绪留在心里，不告诉别人。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 1,
          "responseSetKey": "erq_agreement_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ERQ10_03",
          "content": "希望悲伤或愤怒等消极情绪少一些时，我会改变自己正在思考的内容。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 2,
          "responseSetKey": "erq_agreement_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ERQ10_04",
          "content": "感到高兴等积极情绪时，我会有意识地不把这些感受表露出来。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 3,
          "responseSetKey": "erq_agreement_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ERQ10_05",
          "content": "身处压力较大的情境时，我会试着用有助于自己平静下来的方式去看待这件事。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 4,
          "responseSetKey": "erq_agreement_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ERQ10_06",
          "content": "我会通过不表达情绪来调节自己的感受。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 5,
          "responseSetKey": "erq_agreement_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ERQ10_07",
          "content": "当我想体验更多积极情绪时，我会改变对眼前处境的看法。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 6,
          "responseSetKey": "erq_agreement_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ERQ10_08",
          "content": "我会通过调整对所处情境的理解来调节情绪。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 7,
          "responseSetKey": "erq_agreement_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ERQ10_09",
          "content": "当我有悲伤或愤怒等消极情绪时，我会确保不把这些情绪表现出来。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 8,
          "responseSetKey": "erq_agreement_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ERQ10_10",
